  "body": "Surplus to requirements - Owner says sell! \r\n\r\nStep into a lifestyle of ease, elegance, and seaside charm with this beautifully appointed 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom apartment in the iconic Mon Desir complex.\r\n\r\nSet just moments from the golden sands of Takapuna Beach, this 90sqm residence blends lock and leave, low maintenance living with modern comfort and ease. An open plan living area flows to your private balcony, the perfect spot to sip your morning coffee or toast the sunset with a glass of wine.\r\n\r\nInside, the layout is thoughtfully crafted for both comfort and connection, making entertaining a breeze and quiet nights in just as special. The open plan kitchen, living and dining is the hub of the home. The master is private, generously sized and complete with a walk in wardrobe, ensuite and separate access to the balcony. The double bedroom is tucked around the corner next to the family bathroom creating ideal separation and functionality.\r\n\r\nAs a resident, you'll enjoy access to resort style amenities including a heated pool and fully equipped gym, all within a secure, beautifully maintained complex.\r\nWith vibrant cafes, boutique shops, and coastal walks just steps away, this apartment offers more than just a home, it offers a lifestyle.\r\n\r\nHighlights You'll Love:\r\n*\tTwo generous bedrooms & two bathrooms\r\n*\tSunlit open plan living with seamless balcony flow\r\n*\t2 car garage with internal access and remote entry\r\n*\tPrivate balcony with elevated urban outlook\r\n*\tLow maintenance, lock & leave\r\n*\tSecure, well maintained building with excellent on-site managers\r\n*\tHeated swimming pool & fully equipped gym\r\n*\tPrime Takapuna location - walk to the beach, shops, dining & more\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nViewings:\r\nAvailable as advertised or by private appointment.\r\nMeet at The Mon Desir, 175 Hurstmere Road, Takapuna.\r\nCall Travis on 021 619 266 upon arrival\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note all staged photography has been digitally enhanced and virtually staged.",
